    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "but talking to a therapist doesn't change the reality of my life. i'll still wake up, i'll still be exhausted, i'll still be nothing but a resource for everyone else. it feels like a lie to say things will get better when the weight just keeps getting heavier every single day. i just feel so much peace when i think about finally being able to just let go of it all. everything is just so heavy. why is it so hard to just find some peace?",
